WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
SafeSite Compliance Cycle. A quarterly safety-return cycle: reminders, checks, escalations and two Word reports, with nothing sent and no final overwritten.

00:00:07.933 --> 00:00:14.733
1. Plan 2026Q4: 12 facilities, 4 coordinators, returns due 2026-12-15. Twelve invented facilities and four coordinators. Returns are due 15 December; the calendar sets the reminder dates.

00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:26.067
2. Two weeks out: first returns arrive and are checked (as of 2026-12-01). Two weeks out, six returns arrive. Three are refused with the exact reason; correction requests and first reminders are drafted.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:37.000
3. Three days out: corrections come back (as of 2026-12-12). Three days out, the corrections come back and pass. Running the same day again drafts nothing new.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:48.000
4. Past the deadline: escalate what is missing (as of 2026-12-18). Past the deadline, two facilities are overdue. Escalations copy the safety lead, and final reports are refused while returns are missing.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:58.467
5. Late returns arrive; the safety lead approves. The late returns arrive and are marked late. The safety lead approves; a second approval overwrites nothing.

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:08.400
6. Folders kept apart. Working drafts, QA material, approved finals and the outbox are kept in separate folders.

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:14.933
What it produced: workshop_2026Q4_FINAL.docx - page 1. The Workshop & Studio report, approved.

00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:21.467
What it produced: depot_2026Q4_FINAL.docx - page 1. The Warehouse & Depot variant is organised around open actions.

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:28.000
What it produced: outbox/2026Q4/2026Q4-F03-correction-F03_v1.eml. A correction request: the exact problem, drafted, never sent.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:34.533
What it produced: qa/2026Q4/QA_pack_2026Q4.md. The QA pack: every return, its file hash and its reminders.

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:41.533
What this run showed: Each bad return refused with its reason; Reminders never duplicated, never sent; No final until every return was in; An approved final is never overwritten. Tests: 11 passed.
